# The linewidth factor turns the gain change during a pulse into a frequency shift, which detunes a firing pillar from its dark neighbour: a larger factor slows the pulse and finally stops it.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Chain of 8 with linewidth factor 5
laser alpha=5
sites 8
path 1 8 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
run 3000
expect total 1
expect last 12.75673 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 12.75673 0.003
expect peak 1 58.507058 2e-4
expect count 2 0
expect count 3 0
expect count 4 0
expect count 5 0
expect count 6 0
expect count 7 0
expect count 8 0
expect silent 2 8
